# HaloBand architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/haloband.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/haloband.md).

**Permanent decision:** one **HaloBand** personal device shell. Tabs are apps
(Home, Comms, Missions, Map, Inventory, Mall, Ship) — not competing overlays.
Open (default **F2**) **suppresses input**; world keeps simulating. HaloBand is
presentation only; inventory / Mall / chat / vitals outcomes stay domain +
server. Mall tab only with live wiring (AC ≠ dock ARC). Ship tab only in
ship modes. Map Set Route persists after close → quantum.
[Star Map](../../docs/docs/architecture/star-map.md),
[Player](../../docs/docs/architecture/player.md),
[Content delivery](../../docs/docs/architecture/content-delivery.md).

When changing HaloBand shell, tabs, open/suppress, Map route, Mall, Inventory
vs Personal Inventory, or Menu Manager HaloBand preview, read the full doc
first. Item Mall / AC / Stripe: [Item Mall](../../docs/docs/architecture/item-mall.md).
Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
